00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.310
She's five years old.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.143
She's adorable.

00:04:31.143 --> 00:04:32.820
She's so excited.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:35.380
I think I have, I think
we have a clip of her.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.720
This is her learning to dance.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.760
Watching the Bollywood scene.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.845
She's...
- [Simu] Oh my God.

00:04:40.845 --> 00:04:44.160
(audience applauding)

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.363
This is her excited seeing me.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.651
